{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17158","headline":"奉和圣制重阳日中外同欢以诗言志因示百僚 · 权德舆","name":"奉和圣制重阳日中外同欢以诗言志因示百僚","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"玉醴宴嘉节，拜恩欢有余。\n煌煌菊花秀，馥馥萸房舒。\n白露秋稼熟，清风天籁虚。\n和声度箫韶，瑞气深储胥。\n百辟皆醉止，万方今宴如。\n宸衷在化成，藻思焕琼琚。\n微臣徒窃拚，岂足歌唐虞。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"权德舆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17158.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17158","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}